  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Exodus",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 17,
    "summary": "Israel murmurs for want of water—Moses smites a rock in Horeb, and water gushes forth—Aaron and Hur uphold Moses’ hands so that Joshua prevails against Amalek.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And all the congregation of the children of Israel journeyed from the wilderness of Sin, after their journeys, according to the commandment of the Lord, and pitched in Rephidim: and there was no water for the people to drink.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 87,
            "text": "Num. 33:12 (12–14)."
          },
          {
            "start": 157,
            "end": 164,
            "text": "OR encamped."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 182,
            "end": 191
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 17:1",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherefore the people did chide with Moses, and said, Give us water that we may drink. And Moses said unto them, Why chide ye with me? wherefore do ye tempt the Lord?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "HEB strove with, or complained to. Ex. 32:22."
          },
          {
            "start": 150,
            "end": 164,
            "text": "HEB put the Lord to the test. TG Doubt; Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 17:2",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And the people thirsted there for water; and the people murmured against Moses, and said, Wherefore is this that thou hast brought us up out of Egypt, to kill us and our children and our cattle with thirst?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 64,
            "text": "TG Ingratitude; Murmuring."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 100,
            "end": 102
          },
          {
            "start": 108,
            "end": 112
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
