          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 79,
            "text": "OR complaints, contention. Deut. 9:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 17:7",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Then came Amalek, and fought with Israel in Rephidim.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Num. 24:20; 1 Sam. 15:2 (2–3)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Exodus 17:8",
        "book": "Exodus",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And Moses said unto Joshua, Choose us out men, and go out, fight with Amalek: to morrow I will stand on the top of the hill with the rod of God in mine hand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "Ex. 24:13; 32:17; 33:11; Heb. 4:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 133,
            "end": 136,
